 "version": 1,
 "title": "Trance Pulse",
 "category": "Drums and grooves",
 "text": "Sound: the driving engine of 90s trance: kick on every beat, a rolling bass on every off-beat between the kicks, open hats on the off-beats too, quiet sixteenth ticks. It plays by itself; hold a key around C3 to move the bass.\n\nHow it's built: one Clock at 138. Kick on every BEAT. The bass: a Sequencer on eighths with only the even steps on (the off-beats) \u2192 a saw through the OTA filter, plucked by a short envelope. Hats on the same off-beats, and quieter hats on every 1/16. A Delay.\n\nTweak: the bass filter's CUTOFF, the bass steps' notes, TEMPO.",
